  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/boUavhPr/images/59ff2b0a91fb5abe2a66b6434596ce7e2ec3bbad.png\" alt=\"橫幅\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\">\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <h3>📖關於：</h3>\n    <p>\n        Mod <span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><strong>Mr</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">Crayfish's Furniture Tools: Legacy</span></strong> \n        新增了 3 種工具，可用於操作來自 \n        <span style=\"color: #3598db;\">\n            <strong>\n                <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n                    MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod: Legacy\n                </a>！\n            </strong>\n        </span> 的方塊。\n    </p>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n此模組對於喜歡建造的玩家來說非常有用！\n</div>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <h3>🛠️工具：</h3>\n    <p><span style=\"color: #fbeeb8;\"><strong>旋轉工具 - 旋轉方塊</strong></span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"color: #f8cac6;\"><strong>破壞工具 - 立即破壞方塊</strong></span></p>\n    <p><span style=\"color: #c2e0f4;\"><strong>多功能工具 - 破壞 + 旋轉</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\"> \n<h3>⚙️工具使用範例</h3>\n</div>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MrPup-minecraftkus/MrCrayfishs-Furniture-Mod-Tools-Refurbished/refs/heads/test/1214.gif\" alt=\"工具\">\n</p>",
